The source code in this repository is published so that the judges of the
Google Cloud AI Builder Cup 2026 and anyone else can read, run and evaluate it.
No licence to copy, modify or redistribute it is granted at this time.

Why not an open-source licence yet: the competition rules give the organiser a
right of first refusal on an exclusive licence after the event. An open-source
licence can't be taken back, so the team will choose one after reading those
terms. The Apache License 2.0 text is ready in docs/legal/apache-2.0.txt if the
team decides to use it (replace this file with it).

Third-party packages keep their own licences (see apps/web/package-lock.json and
services/api/requirements.txt). Fonts are under the SIL Open Font License.
All households, people, phone numbers and documents in this repository are
fictional sample data.
